  // StableHLO convolution op does not have a direct conv_transpose op,
  // but conv_transpose can be implemented as a convolution with lhs_dilation and rhs_dilation swapped,
  // and flipping the kernel spatial dims, and swapping input/output channels in the kernel.

  // The PyTorch conv_transpose3d weight shape is (in_channels, out_channels, kD, kH, kW)
  // StableHLO convolution expects kernel shape (out_channels, in_channels/groups, kD, kH, kW)
