  // Actually, PyTorch conv_transpose weight shape is (in_channels, out_channels, KD, KH, KW)
  // StableHLO conv_transpose expects weight shape: [KD KH KW Cout Cin] for conv_transpose (see OpenXLA docs)
  // So we must permute weight from (3,16,3,3,3) to (3,3,3,16,3)
  // Let's permute %arg1 from (3,16,3,3,3) to (3,3,3,16,3) then transpose last two dims to (3,3,3,3,16)
  // Actually, to match StableHLO conv_transpose weight shape: [KD KH KW Cout Cin]
