  // matmul_weight shape: [7,7], input shape: [6,7]
  // We want to do input [6x7] * matmul_weight^T [7x7] = [6x7]
  // So dot_general with contracting dims: input dim 1, weight dim 1 (weight is [7x7], we want to contract dim 1)
  // But weight needs to be transposed to [7x7], so transpose dims [1,0]
