  // Actually, stablehlo conv padding is low and high padding per dim.
  // For ConvTranspose2d, padding attribute is (kernel_size - 1 - padding) for low padding and output_padding for high padding.
  // So low padding = kernel_size - 1 - padding = 3 - 1 - 1 = 1
  // high padding = output_padding = 1
