  // But stablehlo.conv expects dimension_numbers attribute symbol reference, define it inline:

  // Define dimension_numbers attribute inline:
  // Using the syntax from the doc: #stablehlo.conv<[b, i, 2, 3]x[o, i, 2, 3]->[b, o, 2, 3]>
  // b=batch, i=in_channel, o=out_channel, 2=height dim, 3=width dim

