  // But this is not a transpose.
  // So we must do a stablehlo.reshape to (7,6,16), then stablehlo.reshape to (6,7,16) by stablehlo.reshape + stablehlo.broadcast_in_dim + stablehlo.reshape.
  // But this is not a transpose.
